<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= typeof title !== 'undefined' ? title : 'Página no encontrada' %> | Condominio360</title>
    <link href="/css/output.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/assets/images/isotipo-naranja.svg">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, sans-serif; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 antialiased min-h-screen flex flex-col">
    <nav class="w-full border-b border-slate-100 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center h-20">
                <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3 group">
                    <img src="/assets/images/isotipo-naranja.svg" alt="" class="h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0" style="object-fit: contain;">
                    <span class="text-xl sm:text-2xl text-slate-900 tracking-tight" style="font-weight: 800;">Condominio360</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/login" class="text-slate-700 font-semibold hover:text-orange-600 transition text-sm sm:text-base">Iniciar sesión</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-16">
        <div class="max-w-lg w-full text-center">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-20 h-20 rounded-2xl bg-orange-100 text-orange-600 mb-8 shadow-inner">
                <svg class="w-10 h-10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9.172 16.172a4 4 0 015.656 0M9 10h.01M15 10h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-orange-600 uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Error 404</p>
            <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Página no encontrada</h1>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
                La dirección que intentaste abrir no existe o ya no está disponible. Si llegaste aquí desde un enlace, comprueba que esté completo o vuelve al inicio.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center">
                <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-orange-500 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-full font-semibold hover:bg-orange-600 transition shadow-lg shadow-orange-500/25">
                    Ir al inicio
                </a>
                <a href="/login" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-slate-200 bg-white text-slate-800 px-6 py-3 rounded-full font-semibold hover:bg-slate-50 transition">
                    Iniciar sesión
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer class="py-8 text-center text-sm text-slate-500 border-t border-slate-100 bg-white">
        <p>© Condominio360</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
